                                    <div class="bg-white pr-4 pl-4 pt-4 pb-2" id="summary">
                                        <h3>Summary</h3>
                                        <hr>
                                            <p>
Describes District Court divisions of King County for purposes of election.    </p>
    <p>
The district court divisions are subject to redistricting (RCW 3.38.010).    </p>
    <p>
In 2006 this data layer changed to the 5 district court divisions of King County from the previous 3.    </p>
    <p>
The boundaries are defined along precinct boundaries (KCC 1.12.050) and an ordinance is submitted to the King County Council when precinct boundary changes alter District Court boundary definitions.    </p>

                                    </div>
